This function modifies the response headers based on the status code and the content of the response. If the content is a scalar reference, it adds a Content-Length header with the length of the content. If the content is a file handle that supports getlines method, it calculates the length of the file by seeking to the beginning of the file and reading all the lines. If there are no headers and the content is undefined, it adds a Content-Length header with a value of 0.

